OPERATOR_NOTES="The observer runs on the third lab host (dg3), not on a database host. When step 9 asks where the observer will run, say so and install the generated bundle on dg3. dg3 already runs another configuration's observer; leave it untouched. Maximum availability comes from step 9; do not run step 13. Flashback Database must be on on both members; enable it on the standby yourself after step 7."

